        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>教学原则与教学方法 手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d9d2c4;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfbf3;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, transparent 25px, #e2e6ea 25px, #e2e6ea 26px);\n    padding: 30px 40px 40px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 1180px;\n  }\n  .binding {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #efece2;\n    border-right: 1px solid #cfc9b8;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .heading {\n    color: #d81b60;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .heading:first-child {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 10px;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n  }\n  .stamp {\n    border: 2px solid #c62828;\n    color: #c62828;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .stamp-wrap {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin: 6px 30px 6px 0;\n  }\n  .footer-note {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .footer-note .label {\n    color: #d81b60;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .side-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -110px;\n    top: 40px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 620px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\n  }\n  .pen-marker {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 90px;\n    top: -8px;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 40px;\n  }\n  .small-mark {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"binding\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder pen-marker\">[Photo: pen clip, top edge]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <!-- 左栏 -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">直观性原则（望梅止渴予适用）</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴运用多种直观⑵ 或直观与现代化教学手段</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵直观教具的演示要适应语言描述相结合</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶注重视觉与语言描述</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷防止运用中形式[?]适用</div>\n\n      <div class=\"stamp-wrap\"><span class=\"stamp\">教学</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">启发性原则（＜孔子·夜问＞）</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴加强学习的目的性教育，调动学习的主动性</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵启发学生独立思考，发展逻辑思维能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶让学生动手，培养独立解决问题的能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷发扬教学民主，创造性建立自主的师生关系</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">循序渐进原则（＜学习主任｜论述法＞）</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴教学的教程要有系统性</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵注意重点难点或者由易到难的教学</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶按照学生的认识规律，由浅入深，由简到难教学</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷将系统连贯性与阶段方序性结合起来</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">巩固性原则（＜生态学＞）</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴要在教授过程中加强知识巩固</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵组织好各种学生的复习工作，教会学生会心的</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶在扩充组织和运用知识中来取的巩固</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">量力性原则（可接受性）</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴了解学生的发展水平，从实际出发进行教学</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵考虑学生认识发展的时代性</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">因材施教原则</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴针对学生的特点进行有别的教学</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵采取有效的教育措施，使学生的才能得到充分发展</div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-note\">\n        <span class=\"label\">方法：</span>①面向多数学生　②让每位学生参与<br>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:36px;\">③询问每一位学生</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 右栏 -->\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">思想性与科学性相统一原则</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴确保科学性的思想性。</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵贯彻教材的思想性原则</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶在教学中有机的结合的资料，举例和素材</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷教师要注意思想性的方式和方法</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑸提高各内容的科学性和品德教育</div>\n      <div class=\"small-mark\">米米</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">理论联系实际原则</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴从书本知识出发注重联系实际</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵重视培养学生运用知识的能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶正确处理知识教学与技能训练的关系</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷补充必要的乡土教材</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">讲授法：</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴注意语言清晰</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵要有组织的教学内容</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶要组织讲述艺术</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷要组织学生听讲</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">谈话法：</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴要作好谈话问题和谈话的计划</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵要善于提问</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶要善于引导学生谈话</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷要做好谈话的组织与小结</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">讨论法：</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴讨论的问题要有吸引力</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵要善于引起讨论并组织学生进行讨论和指导</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶要做好讨论的小结</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">读书指导法</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑴明确目的，重点和思考题</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑵教给学生读书方法</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑶要指导学生在读书中发现问题与解决问题</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">⑷组织学生交流读书心得</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder side-strip\">[Photo: adjacent book pages, left edge of image]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
